 "body_text": "So I just spent the last few days testing all the creative AI tools \n\nlearn how to create the best AI ads for your brand or business. \n\nSo I’m going to show you exactly how you can create the best AI ads in under 20 seconds.\n\nAnd yeah, you can be the face of it too. \n\nSo here’s how to do it.\n\nFirst, record yourself holding the product, then take a screenshot of the best frame.\n\nNow go to Arcads and select the ‘Add actors’ section. \n\nClick ‘create new actor’ and upload that screenshot.\n\nWrite a prompt detailing what you want to change about the image select your aspect ratio, and download your new photo.\n\nNow head to Kling 2.6 Motion Control. \n\nUpload your original video, then upload the new image.\n\nIt’ll transfer that motion into the image, and you can create unlimited ads targeting different regions and age groups like this.\n\nSo if you want to try this for yourself, drop ‘Arcads’ in the comments\n\n#aitools #aivideo #arcads #ugc",
